From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:54:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/29] search: keep archive cleanup independent of runtime
 shutdown

Use synchronous filesystem operations on the existing dedicated archive cleanup thread. Tokio blocking-pool shutdown must not prevent late cache handles from deleting retired directories. Preserve symlink exclusion, missing-path tolerance and failure behavior, and cover nested read-only cleanup.
